Agent Canvas is fetched from upstream at the commit pinned in
apps/canvas/UPSTREAM.json, and the patch files in apps/canvas/patches/ contain
portions of OpenHands code. Those portions, and OpenHands itself, are licensed
under the MIT License below, not under the AtherNull Proprietary License above.
The OpenHands SDK, tools and Agent Server used by workers/coding-agent are
installed as dependencies under their own licenses.

